  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single storey detached front garage and associated boundary treatment, by reason of its siting within the front garden and the predominance of hard surfacing without appropriate landscaping, would result in a visually intrusive form of development that fails to respect the established character and appearance of the Parkstone Avenue street scene. The proposal would therefore cause harm to the visual amenity of the area and is contrary to Policy 26 of the Havering Local Plan (2021) and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2011).",
    "The proposed boundary treatment, by reason of its height, design, and positioning, would appear visually dominant and out of keeping with the open and landscaped character of the surrounding area. It would detract from the street scene and result in harm to the visual amenity of Parkstone Avenue. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy 26 of the Havering Local Plan (2021) and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2011)."
